{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5208b1539a954649057945c740e870704525d6eeea13108bd208f6de1fbce443", "ja": "（765プロの今後の鍵となる39プロジェクト。\nその準備も、大詰め…。ここが頑張りどころだな！）", "zh": "（39PROJECT堪称765艺能今后发展的关键。\n相关准备也进入最后阶段……此时更该加把劲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b2dd164aa43fc8a6a99ab8f664a76d1d43f586483d5ed17e7970dba78b877e0c", "ja": "あれ、貴音？　劇場に来てたのか。\nでも、こんな時間なのに……どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦，贵音？你来剧场啦。\n不过，这么晚还过来……有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "e17fe17d3a2dbb75132f6ab506317ded23ce69223604dd1959091b98863bbea9", "ja": "{$P$}こそ……。\nこのような時間まで、お一人で？", "zh": "{$P$}才是……\n你一个人待到这么晚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "986ece39fca2bb0dc75d5b08132a986255981e5ac4420c3e4c3dba8135e46e62", "ja": "ああ、39プロジェクトの始動も目前だから、\nしっかり準備しておこうと思って。", "zh": "是啊，因为39PROJECT即将正式开始，\n我想好好准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "86cf9f1d031cd8639957cff03a07e82b792d7904355f09b094be33bfed8eb274", "ja": "そうですか……。\n三九ぷろじぇくと、やはり壮大なものなのですね。", "zh": "这样啊……\n「三九PROJECT」，果然是很庞大的企划呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "f8766ee110c84194440fa429b2f146b2a4ade624ccc41a04530e528926960cec", "ja": "{$P$}。\n私にも、何かお手伝いできることはありませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n有什么小女子能帮上忙的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "625284bc3a70e6604e7066f64b627fa80ca643f826789d1192237b76a8fa7973", "ja": "ありがとう。\nでも大丈夫……いや、まてよ？", "zh": "谢谢你。\n不过没关系……不，等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "929feec7fc27ffbc3193f7a5ba085ac43d1e54ffccb238adc38f1c7912683b5b", "ja": "もしかして貴音は、俺を手伝うために、\nわざわざ来てくれたのか？", "zh": "贵音，你该不会是为了帮我，\n才特地过来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "ddba72dd044833f9f7af692c235be37422742e1b7d9646085858fce2070187eb", "ja": "は、はい……。\n差し出がましい振る舞い、お許しください。", "zh": "是、是的……\n请原谅小女子多管闲事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "3b804e945d2e031694d16be736d5cc34f8ba61c696f2a7ae9421c2c2ed4b1d90", "ja": "無論、三九ぷろじぇくとの采配を握っているのは、\n{$P$}ただ一人。", "zh": "当然，掌握「三九PROJECT」指挥权的\n只有{$P$}一人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "ffd5cedc17251c0359c834c515efb566b9de418f936f0365c821afe1c60b11c1", "ja": "ですが、だからといって……\nあまりご無理をなさっては、お体に障ります。", "zh": "但就算这样……\n要是太勉强自己，身体会出问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "812e1e7c291564301c049c489d030b3f531027a070119cdab628ca5c4483d395", "ja": "そうか。気遣ってくれてありがとう。\nそれじゃ、せっかくだから頼んでおくけど……。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢你的关心。\n既然你都特地过来了，我就拜托你帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_1013", "source_sha256": "7c6c1ef058e1648cc30bd18309587a8ae69bcbff496a05685facac0169ac81a8", "ja": "後輩達を見守って欲しい", "zh": "帮忙照看后辈们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "33bfda8160c1c7e56125ef7db10b25e04cc6cdb239b4170d247e994b1f1549d4", "ja": "俺のことはさておき、\n貴音は、後輩達を見守ってくれるかな？", "zh": "先别担心我了，\n贵音可以帮忙照看后辈们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2001_008tak", "source_sha256": "31385e9c10728afda4b6501d651b6ed2fb522e9602974aeb4212df3c66e43a8d", "ja": "後輩……三九ぷろじぇくとで\n新たに加わった、彼女達を？", "zh": "后辈……你是指照顾\n在「三九PROJECT」新加入的她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "921066efea3ecfdba5e97ff61793df874658ac43985a52ae097253bb775039dc", "ja": "ああ。\n貴音なら、いい先輩になってくれそうだ。", "zh": "是呀。\n贵音应该会是个很棒的前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2003_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a427211fe2da78e24377017d248a6384dc0af92068cfed045b6281c3c8338fd", "ja": "それは……もちろん、そのつもりではいますが、\n私もまだまだ道半ばの未熟者です。", "zh": "那个……小女子当然也希望如此，\n然而小女子尚不成器。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2004_008tak", "source_sha256": "ca24b490ef807f4a603a65044dfd7f0b97e0fdddb9bcc3369d98af21d62e26b5", "ja": "{$P$}が望まれるような、\n良き先達となるには……、力不足かと。", "zh": "要成为{$P$}期望中的优秀前辈……\n恐怕心有余而力不足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "0a534d334293e889e3989e4c4619fdedfaaa37e42697ca47e70e221304d1548a", "ja": "そう難しく考えなくていいよ。\n貴音は、今まで通り振る舞ってくれるだけで。", "zh": "不用想得那么复杂啦。\n贵音只要表现得像平常一样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2006_008tak", "source_sha256": "fc5ccefb11810fe4c0b7e3f5e83f79ea803467f7927119096e285d6d26b38744", "ja": "ですが、それではあまりに……。\n何もしないのと同じではありませんか？", "zh": "但那样实在说不过去……\n不就像是什么都没做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "a4728cb3b0a43e483464f10a5af04fed86d9ceb772b12552c545d4310a2a9ce1", "ja": "いや、そもそも貴音なら、俺が頼まなくても\n後輩達を気にかけて、声も掛けてくれそうじゃないか。", "zh": "不，就算我没有特别拜托贵音，\n你应该也会把后辈们放在心上，开口关心她们吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "a1d87cb0d767b0fc2501c37e08734edbc83fb97f164acd6657bf3b914ac9cda2", "ja": "ほら、こうして俺に声をかけてくれたみたいに。\nだから、今まで通りってことで！", "zh": "就像你现在想说帮我一样。\n所以，就像平常一样就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2009_008tak", "source_sha256": "413d0f298bb1359ee27dc8980a4f893dbbf7649aba97d5db1eb1febb84625b05", "ja": "まあ……。", "zh": "哎呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2010_008tak", "source_sha256": "d3bfb271c0e9bae907af24c20ada66c5f3d45724d0083fd2cd0fe47cfb25b186", "ja": "ふふっ、なにやら一本取られた気がいたします。\n真、いけずなお方ですね。", "zh": "呵呵，感觉被摆了一道。\n着实是个坏心眼的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "1946675eb6a254b0fe0df0f5ed4c5d36fab4d1732dc100e626cadacaadde697d", "ja": "あ、そういうつもりじゃなかったんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，我不是那个意思啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2012_008tak", "source_sha256": "cd165e41fb3efa4063bb11ec2c1f0e2e8a21fffb8009525bff54cc475d1d3f16", "ja": "いえ、よろしいのです。\nおかげで、ようやく得心いたしました。", "zh": "不，没关系的。\n多亏这样，小女子终于明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2013_008tak", "source_sha256": "e11dad54f5bc80afeec5613aba09da1b37c8f2d64be2465cae9c251f8f7d56a3", "ja": "見守るといっても、私はまだまだ至らぬ身。\n人を教え導くほどの、強い光は放てないでしょう。", "zh": "就算说要照看人，小女子还远不成熟，\n尚未散发出足以教导他人的耀眼光芒吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2014_008tak", "source_sha256": "7cd6023157c164f8e5409aea335bc79acc6a683c19f5062dd2114347893346e3", "ja": "ですが、足元を照らす月明かり程度の光であれば、\n今の私にも……。", "zh": "但是，若只是足以照亮脚边、月光般的微光，\n现在的小女子应该……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "b462f2729e1ebd9a1c536967084a63d1059b657c11892fdd3a9e15effdf784e3", "ja": "それで十分だ。\n闇夜よりは月夜の方が、はるかに心強いしな。", "zh": "那就够了。\n比起一片漆黑的夜晚，有月亮照耀会让人更安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2016_008tak", "source_sha256": "26ce194518fa769da76eae987a00580247fcba6af00050fbdf0553a178ade984", "ja": "はい……よく存じています。\n私も光に導かれて、ここまで来たのですから。", "zh": "是……小女子很清楚。\n因为小女子也是受光所引导，才能来到这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2017_008tak", "source_sha256": "dce10efe3f1875e89c39e6edfa916dad3ab118c789ae001316d3c6d1983de664", "ja": "今宵もまた、そうであったように……。", "zh": "就像今晚，也是如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2018_p", "source_sha256": "d6faab4ab25a6aaabe24d72a4f4d52f5a91c30c228c7d81371b1d11690caa57f", "ja": "（貴音が外した視線の先には、窓の外の夜空。\n見ているのは、自身が今まで歩いてきた道か……）", "zh": "（贵音移开视线，看向窗外的夜空。\n她所凝视的，是自己至今走过的路吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_001_2019_p", "source_sha256": "66fff5961360d0aa8ff408b897e70311ab2e8e1702ff40f7ee7f76983c486669", "ja": "（それとも、その道をたどり始めた後輩達の姿か。\nあるいは、はるか遠くの月そのもの……）", "zh": "（还是后辈们刚踏上那条路的身影呢？\n又或是在远眺高挂的月亮呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
